{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……愛理，還好嗎？」", "text_idx": 219, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 266, "voice": "sk0630", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「抱歉，謝謝妳……感覺還可以……」", "text_idx": 236, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 260, "voice": "ar3066", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──愛理的身體狀況一個晚上沒辦法完全恢復。", "text_idx": 212, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那、那就開始了……把答案卷翻過來。」", "text_idx": 246, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "萬智", "alt_speaker_idx": 272, "voice": "mc0148", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……唔唔。」", "text_idx": 215, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 260, "voice": "ar3067", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她還是來學校了。", "text_idx": 257, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "這件事我實在無法阻止她。", "text_idx": 274, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她咬著牙也要參加考試。", "text_idx": 256, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「小愛理，這個對感冒很有效喔。喝得下的話就喝吧……」", "text_idx": 234, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 271, "voice": "mu0288", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「謝謝妳……」", "text_idx": 241, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 260, "voice": "ar3068", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯嗯，今天也很努力呢。明明應該躺下休息的才對……」", "text_idx": 227, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 271, "voice": "mu0289", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "沒有充分休息，感冒當然無法痊癒。", "text_idx": 268, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "身體一直是虛弱的狀態。", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……妳那樣沒問題嗎？愛理。」", "text_idx": 218, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 269, "voice": "sn0196", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「剛才的文法怎麼樣？」", "text_idx": 220, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 275, "voice": "ht0229", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊……剛才是考文法啊……」", "text_idx": 225, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 260, "voice": "ar3069", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「喂喂……」", "text_idx": 226, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 269, "voice": "sn0197", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因為身體不舒服，她沒辦法認真考試，完全無法發揮實力。", "text_idx": 253, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是，她還是考完全部的科目──", "text_idx": 251, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好，請把答案卷交上來。」", "text_idx": 232, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "萬智", "alt_speaker_idx": 272, "voice": "mc0149", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 213, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 260, "voice": "ar3070", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔唔。」", "text_idx": 224, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 260, "voice": "ar3071", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "結束後，愛理精疲力盡地趴在桌上。", "text_idx": 270, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾同學，暫時麻煩你一個人扶一下了，愛理同學，跟妳借鑰匙喔……」", "text_idx": 237, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 258, "voice": "ag0571", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「愛理、愛理，再撐一下下。」", "text_idx": 235, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 266, "voice": "sk0631", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呼……」", "text_idx": 221, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 264, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這樣終於可以休息了……」", "text_idx": 245, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 258, "voice": "ag0572", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我跟安潔扶著愛理回到她家。", "text_idx": 263, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "櫻乃和天羽學姊也因為擔心而一起來。", "text_idx": 267, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「購物麻煩紗凪去了……」", "text_idx": 242, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 271, "voice": "mu0290", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，小愛理，把制服換下來吧？順便擦拭一下身體喔。」", "text_idx": 228, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 271, "voice": "mu0291", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安潔立刻去準備！」", "text_idx": 233, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 258, "voice": "ag0573", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哥哥。」", "text_idx": 222, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 266, "voice": "sk0632", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，總之先換衣服……」", "text_idx": 229, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 264, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在櫻乃的眼神示意下，我打開衣櫃拿出愛理的便服。", "text_idx": 254, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這套可以嗎？來。」", "text_idx": 243, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 264, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我把衣服遞給學姊，大家不知道為什麼都臉紅了。", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯？那個，不對嗎？」", "text_idx": 231, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 264, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……剛才是請你先出去一下的意思。」", "text_idx": 214, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 266, "voice": "sk0633", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「說、說的也是呢，瓜生君當然知道替換的衣服在哪裡。」", "text_idx": 240, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 271, "voice": "mu0292", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是說新吾同學的衣物也放在同樣的地方呢。啊唔，這種不經意的刺激感……」", "text_idx": 238, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 258, "voice": "ag0574", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……啊～」", "text_idx": 216, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 264, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "意識到此時的情況，我的臉也熱了起來。", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是，我跟愛理的確是「那種關係」沒有錯。", "text_idx": 252, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「總、總之，先幫她換衣服吧。」", "text_idx": 239, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 264, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，說的也是。戀人在身邊，小愛理也比較安心吧。」", "text_idx": 230, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 271, "voice": "mu0293", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……妳能這麼想真是太好了。」", "text_idx": 217, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 264, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那小愛理，要扶妳起來囉～」", "text_idx": 247, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 271, "voice": "mu0294", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔……唔唔……不行……沒辦法、沒辦法……」", "text_idx": 223, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 260, "voice": "ar3072", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這樣下、去……唔、唔唔、結果……」", "text_idx": 244, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 260, "voice": "ar3073", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "大家面面相覷。", "text_idx": 255, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "愛理在夢中也在考試嗎？一直囈語著沒辦法沒辦法……", "text_idx": 261, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
